      "releaseNotes": "• Plex: sign in with your Plex account and watch your movies and shows on iPhone and HomeView, picking up where you left off.\n• Your libraries show up by their own names, for Plex and Jellyfin.\n• The menu lists each of your sources, like your HDHomeRun, playlists, Jellyfin and Plex, on iPhone and HomeView. Prefer the old layout? Settings → Menu → Group Menu → By Type.\n• Home shows the last 3 channels you watched.\n• When you add a source, each channel shows what's on right now, and the guide fills in on its own.\n• Pasting a playlist into Add Stream (or a single stream into Import Playlist) now points you to the right place.\n• Fixed: playlists, streams and some HDHomeRun tuners with http:// links wouldn't load.",
